-08:00","id":1555621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1555602-i-played-in-the-latest-convention-of-thorns-larp-ama?p=1555609#post1555609\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How would you describe what the Convention of Thorns event to someone who doesn't know anything about it?</div> </div> </div> </div>There has been a Vampire Civil War and now, a group of powerful Vampires have invited all comers to a peace summit to enkrone the war before it results in the destruction of their kind at the hands of mortal vampire hunters.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-19T06:40:34-08:00","id":1555630,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1555602-i-played-in-the-latest-convention-of-thorns-larp-ama?p=1555603#post1555603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This seems silly but its a big think for me in larp-what was the food like?</div> </div> </div> </div>It is not that silly you know<br /> <br /> There is a bit forgotten secondary skill from &quot;Dirty Secrets of the Black Hand&quot;.on page 70, named &quot;Blood Preparation&quot;:<br /> <br /> <b>BLOOD PREPARATION</b><br /> You know the effects of various substances on the blood. You can use this knowledge to recognize foreign substances in any blood you taste, and you also know the art of feeding your victims certain substances to get the desired taste and effects. You are knowledgeable in chemicals, intoxicants, herbs, spices and food and how they affect mortal and inmortal blood. You can prepare a variety of flavours for blood feasts, and are capable of combining this art with Toxicology to make the blood of a living mortal dangerous to the Kindred.<br /> \u2022 Novice: You are a dabller; you can prepare simple meals.<br /> \u2022\u2022 Practiced: Yot know several recipes and can perpare a variety of meals.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 Competent: You know many recipes, though you have trouble preparing truly exotic cusine.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Expert: You are and excellent chef; you know all the great recipes as well as a wide range of exotic recipes.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Master: You are a master chef; you know a great variety of recipes and you can create your own masterpieces.<br /> Possesed by: Some Toreador, Sabbat, Baba Yaga's chefs, Black Hand Kindred and some cannibals.<br /> Specialities: Intoxicants, Spices, Easy-to-prepare meals, Kindred Poisons, Recognizing and Analysing Tastes.<br /> <br /> Blood foods, blood-bread, blood-puding, blood-wine, several blood sweets... a nice feast is always fun in an Elysium or in an Elder's banquet hall especially if your host is on the Via Voluptarius/Path of Pleasure <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Vampire parties can be fun<br /> <br /> I LARPed a vampire chef more than once to explain the foods we served during LARP","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-19T09:27:42-08:00","id":1555633,"title":"","content":"Well, the food hall was off-game, so\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelance Writer and Storyteller's Vault contributor. Find my work here: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/index.php?affiliate_id=17903\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.storytellersvault.com/ind...liate_id=17903</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1535-jackob","name":"Jackob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1535_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-21T09:35:31-08:00","id":1555727,"title":"","content":"And here's the episode: <span style=\"font-family:Aptos\">https://wodarkages.squarespace.com/podcast/convention-of-thorns-after-action-report</span><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/>